OUTCOME CLASSIFIED
CHECK ClassAssertion(<http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#CustomerWithEmail> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#alice>) ENTAILED
CHECK SubClassOf(<http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#CustomerWithEmail> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#RegisteredCustomer>) NOT_ENTAILED
CHECK SubClassOf(<http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#RegisteredCustomer> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#Party>) ENTAILED
SUBCLASS <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#Customer> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#Party>
SUBCLASS <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#CustomerWithEmail> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#Customer>
SUBCLASS <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#RegisteredCustomer> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#CustomerWithEmail>
TYPE <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#alice> <http://example.org/el-intersection-existential#RegisteredCustomer>
